{"id":"36d7982292843823","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-spectrum.md","title":"Spectrum of a Theory","display":"df-spectrum — Spectrum of a Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-spectrum","aliases":["58-df-spectrum"],"display":"df-spectrum — Spectrum of a Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spectrum — Spectrum of a Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinality candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (model predicate and structure carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\\)</span> (definable class notation for the model-cardinality spectrum)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|=\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|=\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The spectrum of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is the set of cardinalities of models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For a theory with arbitrarily large models, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\\)</span> is a proper class; the displayed membership biconditional is therefore class notation, not an assertion that the spectrum is a ZFC set.</li>\n<li>Upward Lowenheim-Skolem gives larger models when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> has an infinite model; finite spectra require separate hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (理论, see [[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)$ and $\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)$ (model predicate and structure carrier, see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Spec}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Spec}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|=\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Spec}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1511,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-spectrum.md|58-df-spectrum]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["90ce6acf0c65af45","5fb1c2241d1943d1","8b6a90316aad78a4","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}